  tierReadouts:
  - TierLabel: LV1 Fire Breath
    StageRole: Expensive ranged summon that trades speed and cadence for a wide flame
      lane.
    PlayerUse: Spend only when the boss is committed and the player can live without
      a blocker.
    SummonRead: Fire dragon hovers above the lane and breathes one broad fire lance
      from a visible orange beam.
  - TierLabel: LV2 Furnace Sweep
    StageRole: Mid-tier dragon breath covers a wider lane and rewards a longer punish
      read.
    PlayerUse: Hold EN when the boss will remain exposed after the first breath tick.
    SummonRead: Larger hovering dragon, two fire chunks, wider lateral spread, and
      a stronger breath beam.
  - TierLabel: LV3 Inferno Beam
    StageRole: High-risk high-return dragon that should visibly dominate a punish
      window.
    PlayerUse: Save for the long boss recovery where raw damage matters more than
      defense.
    SummonRead: Largest hover silhouette, three wide fire chunks, long orange breath
      beam, and slow high-cost burn pressure.
